Owner requirement 14/11/2026: the File page (BackstageWindow::GetPlacement) starts below the document tab
strip ("Không tên 1 / 2 / …", framework DocumentTabBar, now with the id "hst-document-tabs") when it shows,
else below the ribbon's tab row as before; it still ends left of the banner, on gen, gtk3 and Windows alike.

